Z||000004||DaRkLoRD||09-11-2000||09:11 AM||||Well, I went to the show on saturday and met some cool people!!<P>I saw my first V8 Fiero (in person I mean) as well as a blue Northstar job.. some amazing Ferrari kits.. talked to a guy who has some very cheap wheels for me.. and another guy that's built some electronics to connect a laptop to the ECM through a serial cable.. useful for reading sensor values in realtime.<P>I got some good photos of the cars, gave a few Fiero cards out, including one to the president of GTA Fieros and another to the owner of Race-Tech (aka The Fiero Shop)<P>I wanted to talk with RSM as well, but apparently they left early...<P>Anyway, the photos will be taken in to be developed this week and I'll post them here as soon as I get them back!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||10
